  "user_request_original": "Design an aperiodic multilayer stack on fused_silica substrate with air incidence. Stack topology: 24 alternating layers starting with hfo2 adjacent to air, ending with SiO2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos) adjacent to substrate (12 hfo2 layers, 12 SiO2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos) layers). Initial thicknesses: all layers start at 100 nm as a neutral baseline. Optimization variables: all 24 individual layer thicknesses, each independently tunable from 30 nm to 200 nm. Evaluate performance at normal incidence, unpolarized light. Wavelength bands: 200-400 nm (maximize reflectance), 800-1500 nm (maximize transmittance). Material refractive indices from measured datasets for hfo2 and SiO2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos). Total layer count fixed at 24.",
